Z||000000||mblackwell||08-04-2001||02:24 PM||||I hhave noticed that some people are using a program that superimposes a message because it not registered.  I know of a totally free image program that does not do this.  I think this program might be as close to Photoshop as you will get without emptying you wallet.<P>This program is not what I would call easy to use, but you can do really cool stuff with it if you take the time to learn.  I have not yet learned to use it that well.<P>The Program is called The Gimp, and was developed for linux.  There is, hovever, a Windows version.  You can find it here: <A HREF="http://www.gimp.org/~tml/gimp/win32//" TARGET=_blank>http://www.gimp.org/~tml/gimp/win32//</A> <P>||||reg||14
